css:
/* ==== INTERFACE ====
方向：瑞士网格结合教学数据图；高对比蓝色开篇、宽松浅色数据页、以蓝/橙区分复利与固定增加，强调基线、单位和可扫描数字。
token --bg：页面底色。
token --text：正文与主标签颜色。
token --font-sans：正文与控件的中英混排字体。
token --compound / --linear：图表中“复利 / compound”与“固定增加 / fixed increase”的类别色。
token --muted / --focus：辅助文字与键盘焦点颜色。
class .nt-title：中英页标题；可在英文短标题片段上使用 .nt-title-en。
class .nt-kicker / .nt-lead / .nt-note：章节标签、导语与图注说明。
class .nt-formula：公式或必要计算行；数字采用等宽对齐。
class .nt-growth-chart：挂在 SVG 上，提供坐标轴、网格、两类曲线、数据点和标签样式。
class .nt-legend：图例容器；子项用 data-series="compound" 或 data-series="linear"。
class .nt-data-table：真实逐年数据表，数值列右对齐。
class .nt-controls：交互控件功能分组；内部 range、output/.nt-amount 与 button 获得统一样式。
class .nt-button：重置等操作按钮。
variant opening：蓝底标题页，适合白色大标题与问题引入。
variant compare：浅灰数据比较页，强化蓝/橙类别关系。
variant interact：近白交互页，以青色轨道反馈当前调节状态。
默认：不设 data-variant；近白无图背景，保留淡网格，内容可直接排版。
==== /INTERFACE ==== */

@font-face {
  font-family: "NTF-noto-sans-sc";
  src: url("fonts/library/noto-sans-sc/face-0.ttf");
  font-weight: 100 900;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: "NTF-barlow-condensed";
  src: url("fonts/library/barlow-condensed/face-0.ttf");
  font-weight: 400;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: "NTF-barlow-condensed";
  src: url("fonts/library/barlow-condensed/face-1.ttf");
  font-weight: 700;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: "NTF-barlow-condensed";
  src: url("fonts/library/barlow-condensed/face-2.ttf");
  font-weight: 800;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: "NTF-inter";
  src: url("fonts/library/inter/face-0.ttf");
  font-weight: 100 900;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: "NTF-inter";
  src: url("fonts/library/inter/face-1.ttf");
  font-weight: 100 900;
  font-style: italic;
  font-display: swap;
}

:root {
  --bg: #f6f7fa;
  --text: #1d2127;
  --muted: #5f6460;
  --focus: #0b48c2;
  --compound: #0b48c2;
  --linear: #c45c28;
  --aqua: #7bd3c7;
  --rule: #cbd2d8;
  --grid: rgba(29, 33, 39, 0.09);
  --font-sans: "NTF-inter", "NTF-noto-sans-sc", sans-serif;
  --font-display: "NTF-barlow-condensed", "NTF-noto-sans-sc", sans-serif;
  --font-numeric: "NTF-inter", "NTF-noto-sans-sc", sans-serif;
  --fs-h1: clamp(72px, 7.2vw, 124px);
  --fs-h2: clamp(50px, 4.6vw, 78px);
  --fs-lead: 27px;
  --fs-body: 21px;
  --fs-sec: 18px;
  --fs-label: 16px;
  --fs-tick: 13px;
  --space-1: 8px;
  --space-2: 16px;
  --space-3: 24px;
  --space-4: 36px;
  --space-5: 56px;
  --space-6: 80px;
}

html[data-variant="opening"] {
  --bg: #0b48c2;
  --text: #fffdf2;
  --muted: #d9e5ff;
  --focus: #fff09b;
  --rule: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  --grid: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);
}

html[data-variant="compare"] {
  --bg: #f7f6f6;
  --text: #1d2127;
  --muted: #5f6460;
  --focus: #0b48c2;
  --rule: #c8cdd2;
  --grid: rgba(11, 72, 194, 0.085);
}

html[data-variant="interact"] {
  --bg: #fdfffd;
  --text: #1d2127;
  --muted: #586261;
  --focus: #075eaf;
  --rule: #b8ccc9;
  --grid: rgba(33, 98, 95, 0.085);
}

#stage {
  color: var(--text);
  background-color: var(--bg);
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(to right, var(--grid) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--grid) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 80px 80px;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: var(--fs-body);
  line-height: 1.5;
  font-synthesis: none;
  text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
}

html[data-variant="opening"] #stage {
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(115deg, transparent 0 68%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.095) 68% 69%, transparent 69%),
    linear-gradient(to right, var(--grid) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--grid) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 100% 100%, 80px 80px, 80px 80px;
}

html[data-variant="interact"] #stage {
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(to right, var(--grid) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--grid) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(110deg, transparent 0 72%, rgba(123, 211, 199, 0.18) 72% 100%);
  background-size: 80px 80px, 80px 80px, 100% 100%;
}

.nt-title {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: var(--fs-h2);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.04;
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  text-wrap: balance;
}

.nt-title.nt-title--hero {
  font-size: var(--fs-h1);
  line-height: 0.94;
}

.nt-title:lang(zh),
.nt-title :lang(zh) {
  font-family: "NTF-noto-sans-sc", sans-serif;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.035em;
}

.nt-title-en,
.nt-title:lang(en),
.nt-title :lang(en) {
  font-family: "NTF-barlow-condensed", "NTF-noto-sans-sc", sans-serif;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.005em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.nt-kicker {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--text);
  font-size: var(--fs-label);
  font-weight: 750;
  line-height: 1.2;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.nt-kicker::before {
  content: "";
  inline-size: 42px;
  block-size: 5px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  background: var(--compound);
}

html[data-variant="opening"] .nt-kicker::before {
  background: #fff09b;
}

.nt-lead {
  margin: 0;
  max-width: 42em;
  color: var(--text);
  font-size: var(--fs-lead);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.48;
  text-wrap: pretty;
}

.nt-note {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: var(--fs-label);
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.nt-question {
  padding-inline-start: 24px;
  border-inline-start: 8px solid currentColor;
  color: var(--text);
  font-size: clamp(28px, 2.5vw, 42px);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.3;
  text-wrap: balance;
}

.nt-formula {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 0.24em;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 12px 18px 14px;
  border: 2px solid currentColor;
  border-radius: 0;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 89%, transparent);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: var(--font-numeric);
  font-size: clamp(28px, 2.4vw, 42px);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.15;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

html[data-variant="opening"] .nt-formula {
  background: rgba(8, 54, 145, 0.78);
}

.nt-formula small {
  font-size: 0.48em;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}

.nt-rule {
  block-size: 2px;
  border: 0;
  background: var(--rule);
}

.nt-series-compound {
  color: var(--compound);
}

.nt-series-linear {
  color: var(--linear);
}

.nt-legend {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px 30px;
  color: var(--text);
  font-size: var(--fs-label);
  font-weight: 650;
  line-height: 1.3;
}

.nt-legend > [data-series] {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
}

.nt-legend > [data-series]::before {
  content: "";
  inline-size: 34px;
  block-size: 7px;
  background: currentColor;
}

.nt-legend > [data-series="compound"] {
  color: var(--compound);
}

.nt-legend > [data-series="linear"] {
  color: var(--linear);
}

svg.nt-growth-chart {
  display: block;
  max-inline-size: 100%;
  overflow: visible;
  font-family: var(--font-numeric);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums;
}

.nt-growth-chart .grid,
.nt-growth-chart [data-role="grid"] {
  stroke: var(--rule);
  stroke-width: 1;
  vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
  shape-rendering: crispEdges;
}

.nt-growth-chart .axis,
.nt-growth-chart [data-role="axis"] {
  stroke: var(--text);
  stroke-width: 2;
  vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
  shape-rendering: crispEdges;
}

.nt-growth-chart text {
  fill: var(--muted);
  font-size: var(--fs-tick);
  font-weight: 550;
}

.nt-growth-chart .axis-title,
.nt-growth-chart [data-role="axis-title"] {
  fill: var(--text);
  font-size: var(--fs-label);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.nt-growth-chart .series-compound,
.nt-growth-chart [data-series="compound"] {
  fill: none;
  stroke: var(--compound);
  stroke-width: 5;
  stroke-linecap: round;
  stroke-linejoin: round;
  vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
}

.nt-growth-chart .series-linear,
.nt-growth-chart [data-series="linear"] {
  fill: none;
  stroke: var(--linear);
  stroke-width: 5;
  stroke-linecap: square;
  stroke-linejoin: round;
  vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
}

.nt-growth-chart circle[data-series="compound"],
.nt-growth-chart .point-compound {
  fill: var(--bg);
  stroke: var(--compound);
  stroke-width: 4;
  vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
}

.nt-growth-chart circle[data-series="linear"],
.nt-growth-chart .point-linear {
  fill: var(--bg);
  stroke: var(--linear);
  stroke-width: 4;
  vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
}

.nt-growth-chart .value-label,
.nt-growth-chart [data-role="value"] {
  fill: var(--text);
  font-size: var(--fs-label);
  font-weight: 750;
}

.nt-data-table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  color: var(--text);
  font-size: var(--fs-sec);
  line-height: 1.35;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums;
}

.nt-data-table th,
.nt-data-table td {
  padding: 11px 14px;
  border-block-end: 1px solid var(--rule);
}

.nt-data-table th {
  border-block-end-width: 3px;
  font-size: var(--fs-label);
  font-weight: 750;
  text-align: start;
}

.nt-data-table td:not(:first-child),
.nt-data-table th:not(:first-child) {
  text-align: end;
}

.nt-data-table [data-series="compound"] {
  color: var(--compound);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.nt-data-table [data-series="linear"] {
  color: var(--linear);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.nt-controls {
  --surface: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
  --track: #c9d4d8;
  --thumb: #0b48c2;
  color: #1d2127;
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 2px solid #1d2127;
  border-radius: 0;
  box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 rgba(11, 72, 194, 0.18);
}

html[data-variant="interact"] .nt-controls {
  --track: #a9d9d2;
  --thumb: #075eaf;
  box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 rgba(123, 211, 199, 0.45);
}

.nt-controls label,
.nt-control-label {
  color: #1d2127;
  font-size: var(--fs-sec);
  font-weight: 750;
  line-height: 1.35;
}

.nt-controls input[type="range"] {
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 44px;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  background: transparent;
  accent-color: var(--thumb);
  cursor: pointer;
}

.nt-controls input[type="range"]::-webkit-slider-runnable-track {
  height: 10px;
  border: 1px solid #52605f;
  border-radius: 0;
  background: var(--track);
}

.nt-controls input[type="range"]::-webkit-slider-thumb {
  width: 30px;
  height: 30px;
  margin-top: -11px;
  border: 3px solid #ffffff;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--thumb);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #1d2127;
  -webkit-appearance: none;
  appearance: none;
}

.nt-controls input[type="range"]::-moz-range-track {
  height: 10px;
  border: 1px solid #52605f;
  border-radius: 0;
  background: var(--track);
}

.nt-controls input[type="range"]::-moz-range-thumb {
  width: 26px;
  height: 26px;
  border: 3px solid #ffffff;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--thumb);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #1d2127;
}

.nt-controls input[type="range"]:focus-visible,
.nt-button:focus-visible,
.nt-controls button:focus-visible {
  outline: 4px solid var(--focus);
  outline-offset: 5px;
}

.nt-amount,
.nt-controls output {
  color: var(--compound);
  font-family: var(--font-numeric);
  font-size: clamp(48px, 5vw, 82px);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums;
}

.nt-unit {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: var(--fs-label);
  font-weight: 650;
}

.nt-button,
.nt-controls button {
  min-height: 48px;
  padding: 10px 20px;
  border: 2px solid #1d2127;
  border-radius: 0;
  color: #ffffff;
  background: #1d2127;
  box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 #a9d9d2;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: var(--fs-label);
  font-weight: 750;
  line-height: 1.2;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.nt-button:hover,
.nt-controls button:hover {
  color: #ffffff;
  background: var(--compound);
}

.nt-button:active,
.nt-controls button:active {
  translate: 3px 3px;
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #a9d9d2;
}

.nt-axis-labels {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-family: var(--font-numeric);
  font-size: var(--fs-tick);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums;
}

.nt-emphasis {
  color: var(--compound);
  font-weight: 800;
}

html[data-variant="opening"] .nt-emphasis {
  color: #fff09b;
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .nt-button,
  .nt-controls button,
  .nt-controls input[type="range"] {
    scroll-behavior: auto;
    transition: none;
  }
}
